# mutgap_svc_mapper_below_v10: A mapper-ref buffer (type 15) over a mapped surface when the guest wrote version 6, below 10, where the device does not set mapperIOSurfaces. In-process the task asserts the feature before asking the mapper service for the surface (docs/testing.md, section 7.4): the exec that copies out of the buffer (opcode 55, as 67 needs version 109) kills the host. In isolate the service checks no feature and asks the host instead: the buffer is made at version 6 and the copy shows the surface's page. Map and isolate setups only: the IOSurface host device needs a memory map.
